    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "order": 170,
    "anchor": "during-campaign-phases-1-and-2",
    "summary": "In campaign phases 1 and 2, battle rewards are random draws:\n\n- The victor takes a Battle Honour card from the current phase’s deck; their opponent takes a Battle Skill card.\n- On a draw, both players take a Battle Skill card.\n- A player who gained at least 1 Agenda Achieved card in the battle takes 1 extra card of that type alongside, keeps 1 of the cards drawn and puts the rest back in their decks.",
